  "changes": [
    "Secure weapon selects visible evidence and one eligible officer from the chosen team. Target identity and reported position persist through radio delay, queues and input-journal restore.",
    "Physical navigation, bounded view turns and shared hand-reach checks drive ordinary Interact. Other nearby weapons cannot intercept or stall retrieval.",
    "Hold cancels, visible armed threats take priority, completion holds position, and idle/following officers level their view after hands-on tasks.",
    "Five concrete wheel stops use a permanent obstacle part. Their source triangles, physical contact shapes, ownership and persistent response remain; navigation excludes their tops and underlying footprints.",
    "Map decoding distinguishes permanent obstacles from attached breakable fixtures and atomically rejects incompatible breakable/supported/thin/grouped/door/fractured variants.",
    "Full-route final replicas now decode their portable map before applying decoded snapshots.",
    "Directed frontend acknowledgement accepts one recipient; UDP fixture bind retries are spread across the candidate range."
  ],
